# Commit author (mandatory)

Every git commit for this repo MUST use:

- `GIT_AUTHOR_NAME=serhankarakoc`
- `GIT_AUTHOR_EMAIL=serhankarakoc@gmail.com`
- `GIT_COMMITTER_NAME=serhankarakoc`
- `GIT_COMMITTER_EMAIL=serhankarakoc@gmail.com`

Never use `serhan@users.noreply.github.com` or any other email — GitHub maps that to the wrong account (`serhan` / Serhan Özmen).

Prefer `git commit-tree` with those env vars (or a rebuild.cmd that sets them). Do not rely on ambient git config. Do not add Cursor / Co-authored-by trailers.
